# MernCrest Part 06 — Enterprise Staff Portal

Continue Parts 01–05. **Do not remove or rebuild** existing ERP, CRM, portal, chat, or commerce modules.

## Product

**MernCrest Solutions – Enterprise Staff Portal** on `system.merncrest.lk` (local: `?system=1`).

Single integrated platform for staff: CRM, projects, tickets, domains/hosting, finance, HR/ESS, live chat, AI, analytics.

**Target roles:** Admin/Manager · Support · Sales · Developer · Finance (map to existing RBAC + `lib/erp/permission-matrix.ts`).

## Actual stack (use this — not a greenfield monorepo)

| Layer | Current |
|-------|---------|
| App | Next.js 14 App Router (`app/`) — upgrade path Next.js 15 |
| API | Route handlers under `app/api/*` + `lib/*` domain logic |
| DB | PostgreSQL + Prisma (`prisma/schema.prisma`) |
| Auth | Session RBAC (`lib/auth`, `requirePermission`) |
| Real-time | SSE (`lib/chat/events.ts`, `hooks/use-chat-sse.ts`) — extend before Socket.IO |
| Cache/queue | Redis in prod compose — deepen as needed |
| UI shell | `StaffShell` + `app/styles/stitch-portal.css` |
| Design source | **Google Stitch** (`.stitch/DESIGN.md`, project `17402065891171962495`) + **Figma** |

Do **not** introduce a separate NestJS app unless explicitly requested. Deepen modules in place.

## Design (mandatory)

1. Read skill **`.cursor/skills/staff-portal-design/SKILL.md`** before any staff/system UI work.
2. **Google Stitch** = layout, tokens, screen comps (Luminous Enterprise / portal-system variant).
3. **Figma** = component specs, spacing, states, handoff — must match Stitch tokens.
4. Shell: `components/staff/staff-shell.tsx` · login: `components/auth/system-login-view.tsx`.
5. Panels: `stitch-*` classes in `stitch-portal.css` — migrate off legacy `rlk-*` when touching a file.
6. Marketing site (`merncrest.lk`) keeps purple Stitch marketing theme — **do not** mix into system shell.

## Surfaces

| Surface | Path | Shell |
|---------|------|-------|
| Staff ESS | `/staff/*` | `StaffShell` |
| ERP/Admin on system | `/admin/*` on `system.*` or `?system=1` | `StaffShell` (not dark `AdminShell`) |
| System login | `/login?system=1` | `SystemLoginView` |

Routing: `middleware.ts` · `lib/system-surface.ts` · cookie `mc_system`.

