## Integration rules (every new staff feature)

Must wire: **CRM** · **Notifications** · **Reports/Analytics** · **Audit** (`writeAuditLog`) · **Permissions** (`requirePermission`).

Reuse: `lib/erp/*`, `lib/crm/*`, `lib/chat/*`, `lib/billing/*`, approval hub — never duplicate domain logic.

## API conventions

- REST under `app/api/staff/*`, `app/api/erp/*`, `app/api/crm/*`
- Zod validation · paginated list shapes · audit on writes
- Chat links in customer-facing text: `https://merncrest.lk` only (`lib/support/public-site-url.ts`)

## Phasing (deepen in place)

1. **Foundation** — RBAC, shell, dashboard KPIs, Stitch screens per route
2. **Core** — CRM, leads, projects, tickets, finance panels polish
3. **Advanced** — live chat enhancements, domain/hosting ops, monitoring
4. **Enterprise** — AWS, multi-branch, KB, AI modules, PWA offline
5. **Launch** — perf, security audit, deploy via `deploy/deploy.sh`

## Anti-patterns

- Separate NestJS monorepo or `/apps/web` split without approval
- Register.lk / light-teal legacy UI (removed — Stitch only)
- Inventing parallel `clients`/`leads` tables — use existing Prisma models
- Removing smart live chat, SSE, CSAT, or renewal actions
